{"suttaId":"tha-ap512","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3163,3195],"vripara":"91"},"segments":{"tha-ap512:0.3":"Nāḷikeraphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap512:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā, ārāmiko ahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap512:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, gacchantaṃ anilañjase.","tha-ap512:2.1":"“Nāḷikeraphalaṃ gayha, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap512:2.3":"Ākāse ṭhitako santo, paṭiggaṇhi mahāyaso.","tha-ap512:3.1":"“Vittisañjanano mayhaṃ, diṭṭhadhammasukhāvaho;","tha-ap512:3.3":"Phalaṃ buddhassa datvāna, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap512:4.1":"“Adhigacchiṃ tadā pītiṃ, vipulañca sukhuttamaṃ;","tha-ap512:4.3":"Uppajjateva ratanaṃ, nibbattassa tahiṃ tahiṃ.","tha-ap512:5.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap512:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap512:6.1":"“Dibbacakkhu visuddhaṃ me, samādhikusalo ahaṃ;","tha-ap512:6.3":"Abhiññāpāramippatto, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap512:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap512:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap512:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap512:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā nāḷikeraphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap512:11.1":"Nāḷikeraphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap512:12.1":"Kaṇikāravaggo ekapaññāsamo.","tha-ap512:13.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap512:14.1":"Kaṇikārekapattā ca, kāsumārī tathāvaṭā;","tha-ap512:14.3":"Pādañca mātuluṅgañca, ajelīmodameva ca.","tha-ap512:15.1":"Tālaṃ tathā nāḷikeraṃ, gāthāyo gaṇitā viha;","tha-ap512:15.3":"Ekaṃ gāthāsataṃ hoti, ūnādhikavivajjitaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
